00:06:25,740 --> 00:06:32,740
Remember that whatever the components you are using in your house all the equipments are connected in parallel only.

77
00:06:32,740 --> 00:06:33,740
Parallel.

78
00:06:33,740 --> 00:06:35,740
Parallel or shunt connection.

79
00:06:35,740 --> 00:06:36,740
Why?

80
00:06:36,740 --> 00:06:40,740
Because every socket we should get 230 volt.

81
00:06:40,740 --> 00:06:45,740
Every points if you take any two points we should get the potential difference of 230.

82
00:06:45,740 --> 00:06:48,740
If it is serious means problem.

83
00:06:48,740 --> 00:06:54,740
The main issue is if one of the equipment is disconnected or something is happened.

84
00:06:54,740 --> 00:06:56,740
The entire supply will be disconnected.

85
00:06:56,740 --> 00:06:57,740
Why?

86
00:06:57,740 --> 00:07:01,740
Because in case of serious circuit the voltage across the components will be different.

87
00:07:01,740 --> 00:07:04,740
But in case of parallel circuit voltage across the components remains same.

88
00:07:04,740 --> 00:07:06,740
But current will be different.

89
00:07:06,740 --> 00:07:11,740
So normally we prefer the parallel connection only in our domestic wiring.

90
00:07:11,740 --> 00:07:15,740
In domestic wiring the shunt or parallel connection is compulsory.

